## Document Map

- `PRODUCT_SPEC.md`: current behavior, schema, canonical values
- `CHANGELOG.md`, `changelog/`: what changed, when and why
- `ROADMAP.md`: not-yet-built work only, including each epic's sequence
- `docs/decisions/`: why a settled design is the way it is
- `docs/audits/`: point-in-time investigations; re-verify a figure before reusing it
- `docs/handoffs/`: live state between sessions; the newest supersedes all earlier ones
- `CLAUDE.md`: build-session workflow, gates, failure patterns
<!-- BEGIN:strategy -->
- `{{STRATEGY_DOC}}`: positioning, audience, scope
- `{{LAUNCH_PLAN_DOC}}`: launch sequencing and criteria
<!-- END:strategy -->

**CLAUDE.md is the single source for build-session workflow, including the spec-update protocol: don't restate it here, and have every prompt tell Claude Code to follow it.**
Why: two copies of a workflow drift apart, and Claude Code reads the live one.

